# Files AI agents must not read. Cursor's native equivalent of the Read deny rules
# in .claude/settings.json — keep the two lists in sync. See AGENTS.md.
#
# This is a hygiene control, not a security boundary: it stops secrets from ending
# up in a model's context or a commit. It does not stop a subprocess from opening
# the file itself.

# A file holding real values must be named .env, .env.local or .env.<environment>.local.
# Templates are .env.example and stay readable — see AGENTS.md.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
secrets/
*.pem
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
